== Walkthrough ==

Faction Required: King Tormax (Min: Dubious)

You say, 'Hail, King Tormax'

: King Tormax says, 'Greetings, _______.  You know who I am, but I only vaguely know of you. My purpose is simple, I will rule these lands like my father, and my grandfather before him. All tasks but two are inconsequential to me. 

You say, 'What tasks?'

: King Tormax says, 'The tasks are simple, _______. I wish the death of the other 'powers' of this frozen waste land. If you are able to destroy either of my mortal foes, bring me proof of your exploits and you will be known as the hero of Kael Drakkel. 

You say, 'What powers?'

: King Tormax laughs deeply, 'I speak of the foolish old dragon Yelinak and that pitiful Dain Frostreaver.' 

'''[[Lord Yelinak]] is a very tough dragon in [[Skyshrine]]. Kill him and bring back his head ([[Yelinak's Head]]) for your gauntlets.'''

: King Tormax laughs deeply as he takes the bloody head then gives you your reward.

